    /* ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬ÂÃ¢â€šÂ¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬ÂÃ¢â€šÂ¬ 1. TICKER BAR ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬ÂÃ¢â€šÂ¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬ÂÃ¢â€šÂ¬ */
    .almiftah-ticker-bar {
        background: #121212;
        height: 42px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-bottom: 3px solid #C8963E;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 9999;
        width: 100%;
